to do with the scientists.

535
00:32:27,488 --> 00:32:28,696
That was Cahill's assignment.

536
00:32:28,697 --> 00:32:30,948
I spent all my time working
with Putra's men.

537
00:32:30,949 --> 00:32:32,408
What he was doing in that room?

538
00:32:32,409 --> 00:32:34,661
It was 25 years ago, I don't know.

539
00:32:34,662 --> 00:32:36,371
That's your answer for everything.

540
00:32:36,372 --> 00:32:38,289
You're in the perfect line of work,
you know that, Congressman?

541
00:32:38,290 --> 00:32:39,749
[John] <i>What, do you want me to lie to you?</i>

542
00:32:39,750 --> 00:32:42,794
Look, I am as confused
about all this as you are.

543
00:32:42,795 --> 00:32:45,296
The one thing I do know is that
I'm looking at a news report

544
00:32:45,297 --> 00:32:47,131
<i>saying you killed a bunch of people
inside of a hotel,</i>

545
00:32:47,132 --> 00:32:49,467
and then broke out of jail
after assaulting a cop.

546
00:32:49,468 --> 00:32:51,094
[Reacher] He wasn't a cop. He was CIA.

547
00:32:51,095 --> 00:32:53,179
And if I'm so guilty,
why are you still talking to me?

548
00:32:53,180 --> 00:32:55,640
- Good point.
- [phone beeps]

549
00:32:55,641 --> 00:32:58,726
{\an8}[news anchor over TV] <i>The injured officer
was transported to a local hospital,</i>

550
00:32:58,727 --> 00:33:00,228
{\an8}<i>and though severely injured,</i>

551
00:33:00,229 --> 00:33:02,855
{\an8}<i>is believed to be in
non-life-threatening condition.</i>

552
00:33:02,856 --> 00:33:04,899
<i>Authorities are asking for anyone...</i>

553
00:33:04,900 --> 00:33:07,527
Hey, guys? Sorry to interrupt,
but you need to see this.

554
00:33:07,528 --> 00:33:09,278
<i>...dial 911. Again--</i>

555
00:33:09,279 --> 00:33:11,072
{\an8}<i>The injured police officer was--</i>

556
00:33:11,073 --> 00:33:12,699
{\an8}<i>-...to a local hospital and though--</i>
- [Russell] Oh, dear.

557
00:33:12,700 --> 00:33:14,701
{\an8}[reporter] <i>He's possibly armed</i>

558
00:33:14,702 --> 00:33:16,202
{\an8}<i>-and extremely dangerous.</i>
- Uh, it's every channel.

559
00:33:16,203 --> 00:33:18,496
<i>- Do not approach him.</i>
- [siren wailing]

560
00:33:18,497 --> 00:33:20,499
[tense, dramatic music playing]

561
00:33:22,501 --> 00:33:24,210
We got six RPCs headed our way.

562
00:33:24,211 --> 00:33:26,212
- They should've sent more.
- Next move?

563
00:33:26,213 --> 00:33:28,673
Every cop in Philly thinks
I assaulted one of their own.

564
00:33:28,674 --> 00:33:30,299
They'll be out for blood.

565
